      "content": "hotlines dont do anything. it's just talking. what's the point of talking to someone when the reality is that i've lost everything? i'm not just \"sad,\" i'm just done. it's like i'm playing a game where the rules are rigged, and no matter how hard you try to play fair, you just lose. i look around and all i see is this endless cycle of people screwing each other over while the truth doesn't even matter. it's exhausting. why even keep trying to engage with a world that's this broken?",
